From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: MSFT-PATCH: Restore Windows locale and display-name contracts

Restore unblocked, previously shipped locale inputs and legacy aliases in the
CLDR-to-ICU configuration. Preserve the collation-specific Dari mappings and
generate resources from current production CLDR rather than old ICU binaries.
Add independent locale and collation contract tests.
Check requested country/native-language display names and full locale names,
including the unchanged English names for native-only updates.

Restore only the ICU 72 CLDR-MS translation, exemplar, and hour-cycle exception
families, using locale-boundary matching and respecting known-issue controls.
Failures outside those historical exceptions remain errors.

